========================================
 Summary
========================================

1. Valid envelope           -> HTTP 200 (accepted)
2. Replayed envelope        -> HTTP 403 (nonceUnseen: false)
3. Tampered payload         -> HTTP 403 (signatureVerified: false)
4. Missing authorization    -> HTTP 401 (an agent calling directly, bypassing Parmana)
5. Authorized + modified    -> rejected at the Gateway (valid: false, businessTransactionHashMatches: false)

